<p>Since the table is based off of localstorage, I will need to delete that specific array but keep the others. I think I can achieve this by getting that nested arrays index and removing it. Now I am not sure whether I need to use <code>.splice()</code> or another method?. This is the method I have used which has not worked:</p>
