I tried googling this error but people with the same error seem to have completely different code. I have no idea what I am doing wrong or how I should fix this. Please help!</p>,"<p>Your response returns an object instead of an array. The array which you want is placed within <strong>results.details</strong>. So in your code, after data is fetched it becomes an object and the map function won't work on that type of variable.</p>

