Cloud Firestore - Document naming problem<p>I'm having a hard time with implementing the »correct« Cloud Firestore document naming.</p>
<p>I have a web storage server with more than 5000 photos. Photos are named 1.jpg -&gt; 5000.jpg. I have decided to add a comment system for each photo.</p>
