<p>The only thing that currently worked is naming the document like this: »photo_1« -&gt; »photo_5000«, but it's recommended not to use:</p>
<p>Do not use monotonically increasing document IDs such as:
•   Customer1, Customer2, Customer3, ...
•   Product 1, Product 2, Product 3, ...
Such sequential IDs can lead to hotspots that impact latency.</p>
<p>What worked:</p>
<ul>
<li>Photos (collection)</li>
<li>Photo_1 (document)</li>
<li>Photo_comments (collection)</li>
<li>UUIDs (document)</li>
