FindWindowA function does not yield the expected output in dart foreign function interface<p>The following dart code's expected output is the handle to the file explorer window but the output always comes out to be 0 even though the file explorer window does exist!</p>
<pre><code>import 'package:ffi/ffi.dart';
import 'dart:ffi';

void main() {
  DynamicLibrary dl = DynamicLibrary.open('user32.dll');
  final func = dl.lookupFunction&lt;
      IntPtr Function(Pointer&lt;Utf16&gt;?, Pointer&lt;Utf16&gt;?),
      int Function(Pointer&lt;Utf16&gt;?, Pointer&lt;Utf16&gt;?)
    &gt;('FindWindowA');

  print(func(nullptr, 'File Explorer'.toNativeUtf16()));
}
</code></pre>
