How does the "event" parameter contain data? What should I do if I want to create my "onHover"?<p>I have a simple flutter application. It's ok, but I'm trying to understand how <code>onHover: (event){...}</code> works, why &quot;event&quot; contains data? How can I make my own widget have function parameters like that?</p>
<pre class="lang-dart prettyprint-override"><code>import 'package:flutter/material.dart';

